# Cloudflare static-asset headers.
#
# Content-hashed build output: the filename changes whenever the bytes change,
# so it is safe — and the point — to cache it forever. The adapter's asset
# binding serves these files directly, before the Worker runs, so this is what
# keeps a repeat visitor from paying for a Worker invocation to receive an
# unchanged stylesheet.
#
# See https://opennext.js.org/cloudflare/howtos/assets for the source of these
# values.

/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=31536000,immutable
